Z||000000||jlhuber||12-31-2000||10:35 PM||||ever sit arround wondering how much your '88gt that you just got done restoring to better than new condition is worth?  ever wonder how much that ole '70 boss 429 sitting in your garage is worth?  check out this link --&gt; <A HREF="http://www.cpivalueguide.com/main/CPIValueSearch.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cpivalueguide.com/main/CPIValueSearch.htm</A>  it is for the "Cars of Particular Intrest" (CPI) value guide.  this is the book that all the collectors and collectible car dealers that i know of and have dealt with use.  the prices are fair, if you place your car in the correct catagory.  what i mean is if your car has rock chips anywhere or fading paint, even if it is not very noticable, it is not excellent condition.  each car is going to be different obviously, but this is just for a general idea for anyone to use.  i just had a run in with someone who tried to say his car was in excellent condition, buy i would classify it as fair, probably below fair though.  the only drawback is that the online version only gives you the excellent condition price.  to get all the prices you will have to buy the book which is something like $30.00 USD, but this should give you a general idea.  this is not meant to be spam, it is just that i know some people would like to know what their car is worth.  i reccomend the CPI guide if you want to spend the money, or <A HREF="http://www.nadaguides.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.nadaguides.com</A>  if you are cheap like me.<P>------------------<BR>--Jess--<BR> <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/blackeye2/double0smile.gif"> ||||reg||3
Z||000001||DXR_DAD||12-31-2000||11:26 PM||||Add this to your list:<P>"2000" Standard Guide to Cars & prices<BR>Prices for Collector Vehicles 1901-1992<P>Most collectors, appraisers and insurers that I have dealt with use this as a guide.<P>Jess,  I'll look for that one thanks<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004900.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004900.html</A> <P>DXR_DAD||||reg||1
Z||000002||jlhuber||01-01-2001||12:10 AM||||...course, it is like all of my friends tell me, "It is only worth as much as someone is willing to pay for it."  How true that is, well to a certain degree that is.  ...3...2...1 --- ooh...wow...its 2001...woopie  ha! can't you just tell taht I am enthused.  Ah well.  Hey, thanks for the info on that price guide, I did not know of that one.<P>------------------<BR>--Jess--<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/blackeye2/double0smile.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by jlhuber (edited 01-01-2001).]||||reg||1
